0.01: Initial version.
0.011: Improve graph contrast, share acceleration integration setting, and subtract estimated gravity from 3-axis acceleration.
0.012: Use one shared Y-axis minimum and maximum for all three acceleration traces.
0.013: Reset all three acceleration integrators to zero when their displayed integrated values each change by no more than 5% over a 3-second window.
0.014: Remove all integration features; plot pressure and interval-averaged acceleration magnitude as points; auto-scale and label pressure axis; derive time scale from pressure interval; add swipe pause/resume.
0.015: Draw acceleration magnitude as a line graph and show the current sweep position with a vertical red line.
